 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the beginning God created the heavens and the earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The earth was formless and empty darkness lay over the deep",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of God hovered over the face of the waters",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And then God spoke the words that set the world in motion",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God said let there be light",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And there was light",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He saw that the light was good",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And separated it from the dark",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let there be light in the vault of the heavens",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let them shine on the earth from the sky",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God saw all that he had made",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And behold it was very good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He made the two great lights to govern the day and the night",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He made the stars to shine in the vault of the heavens",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He set them to separate the light from the darkness",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And God saw that it was good and the days began",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the waters under the heavens be gathered into one place",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the dry ground appear and God called it land",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
